{
 "command": "settings-layout",
 "notes": [
  "Feeds W8-19b/W8-19c (dialogs::settings::builder::{rows, groups, layout}). Reflection over the internal SettingsLayoutElement family of PhotoReview.dll, run against a deterministic fake ISettingsLayoutSurface (DispatchProxy).",
  "Surface formulas (also in tools/oracle-cs/Commands/W8-19b.cs): Dx(d)=d*dx_mul/dx_div, Dy(d)=d*dy_mul/dy_div (int, truncating); TextWidth(text)=UTF-16 length*avg_char_width; TextHeight(id,w)=heights[id] else max(1,ceil(TextWidth(TextOf(id))/max(1,w)))*line_height; TextOf(id)=texts[id] or empty; IsHidden(id) in hidden; ComboDropHeight(id)=combo_drop[id] or 0.",
  "Output per element case: height (return of Place), calls (['place',id,x,y,w,h] or ['hide',id] in call order), control_ids. label_width -> values."
 ],
 "surfaces": {
  "s100": {
   "dx_mul": 3,
   "dx_div": 2,
   "dy_mul": 15,
   "dy_div": 8,
   "line_height": 16,
   "field_height": 23,
   "avg_char_width": 7
  },
  "s150": {
   "dx_mul": 9,
   "dx_div": 4,
   "dy_mul": 45,
   "dy_div": 16,
   "line_height": 24,
   "field_height": 34,
   "avg_char_width": 10
  },
  "unit": {
   "dx_mul": 1,
   "dx_div": 1,
   "dy_mul": 1,
   "dy_div": 1,
   "line_height": 10,
   "field_height": 14,
   "avg_char_width": 5
  }
 },
